# NFL photo jersey backs (always)

**One silhouette.** Philadelphia Eagles elite cut (V-neck, short sleeves with cuff bands, upper-back nameplate, mesh fabric). Solid `#000` (LED energy). No hanger on photo backs.

**Scale lock:** neckline pinned to the top. Height = prior 129.4% × **0.8** (−20% length) → `background-size: auto 103.5%`; width **+15%** via `transform: scaleX(1.15)` on `.display-background`. Font caps: name ~**6.4vh**, number ~**26–30vh**.

**Helmet:** Optional side mascot/helmet in PNG only after jersey stack is locked; must not touch the right sleeve.

**Wordmark:** baked into the PNG only (club on nameplate), **almost on the inner collar / shoulder** — minimal green gap under the collar. Upright athletic block caps. CSS hides `.soccer-jersey-team` on photo kits.

**Patron name (CSS):** just under the baked nameplate, base `top` ~22% + `var(--nfl-photo-stack-y)` (96× ~21%, 64×48 ~22%, 64×32 ~20%); cap ~6.4vh.

**Number (CSS):** empty mid-back under the name, base `top` ~32% + shift (96× ~31%, 64×48 ~32%, 64×32 ~30%); cap ~26–30vh.

**Dual shoutout layout (`nfl-jersey` / `nflDualLayout`):**
- **Every board size:** 6s `FLOQRFrameLoop` gif — frame 1 = rendered jersey, frame 2 = solid black + shoutout verbiage (emoji OK). FloqR card **bottom** on both phases.
- FloqR card: always **PRESENTED BY FloqMedia** (with classic burst animation). When `@handle` is opted in (`includeAttribution`), alternate every 6s with **FROM @handle**. When handle is absent, FloqMedia only — never hide the card.
- Caps: **64×48 / 96×48** 4×16=64; **64×32** 3×16=48. Checkout uses `nflJersey` (not soccer 8–12).

